    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This section contains language-specific guides on how to reuse existing WebAssembly components, in particular using an `adder` component to complete a `calculator` component.",
      "source_hash": 6307066448714310564,
      "context_hash": 17839989321456703982,
      "translation": "이 섹션에서는 기존 WebAssembly 컴포넌트를 재사용하는 방법에 대한 언어별 가이드를 다루며, 특히 `adder` 컴포넌트를 사용하여 `calculator` 컴포넌트를 완성하는 방법을 설명합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:08.418636Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The `adder` component has the following [WIT][docs-wit] interface:",
      "source_hash": 10456309448569673941,
      "context_hash": 12321858930559715585,
      "translation": "`adder` 컴포넌트는 다음과 같은 [WIT][docs-wit] 인터페이스를 가집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "interface": "인터페이스",
        "component": "컴포넌트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:08.418637Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The `calculator` component has the following interface:",
      "source_hash": 2447039814880081381,
      "context_hash": 13147731205604721026,
      "translation": "`calculator` 컴포넌트는 다음과 같은 인터페이스를 가집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "component": "컴포넌트",
        "interface": "인터페이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-12T05:49:08.418637Z",
